{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26939","headline":"和秘书崔少监春日游青龙寺僧院 · 姚合","name":"和秘书崔少监春日游青龙寺僧院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官清书府足闲时，晓起攀花折柳枝。\n九陌城中寻不尽，千峰寺里看相宜。\n高人酒味多和药，自古风光只属诗。\n见说往来多静者，未知前日更逢谁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}